{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_066eac8f9d884f6d06f1234a7fb82aba444944e039669f1f233d082518f6ebd3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b0d97edaa11cdcfee0493dfeaabc02af605337478db7fd4d8c99e7fded654760"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"Model IDs get a [1m] suffix when the resolved context window is at least 1M tokens, so Claude Code sizes the window correctly and strips the tag before requests; the tag applies to Claude Code only.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0f41e9c95530b0786ac2c41507687213c516e53166cb018bbf687ed31c1c40cf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8fd0b0b6eb935d3eed49c180b7cd16fbdb9e2f8be829b413c19af54b6240a893","slc_ac16b8edb137d1f4d6d6f00021d8b8b60d9ac5f882fd11a76818f5932edcebcb","slc_deab13d5805da1c25e99225cfaf123e83d72230efc77e15fb6db8131c2f6059e","slc_fee0bcf576b27b7333eac74f865490295fac0335c55458e99f681066b3d9958e"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"The CLI is harness-first: `fireconnect <harness> <command>` with per-harness on/off/status/help plus global commands including login, logout, status, model list, configure, upgrade, uninstall, and --version.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_360543b1558aa281bd507f88b21e604793c469d1261dc738c6d72fd48dcf6e5b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1053f6f29a4a1fc84dfadf0cb79b745c4fcd641198cd65a27632aeb48a692abb","slc_3aeccdf900749bf23cda186a08d2641e2006df284199ca58e39a8a978fa0a391"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"For Claude Code, auth is a static X-Fireworks-Api-Key custom header rather than apiKeyHelper, chosen so a leftover Anthropic key cannot silently break routing; the trade-off is a plaintext key in settings.json at mode 0600.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_512e0bfc93b8097ecb3f14dfc0bc1581a9445a65a1381b0b85c5c503f3864b21","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a362563d9b509515900cacec1eda716772ca408bb256edba1869209fc357d1ff"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"MiniMax is not supported on Codex because Codex may insert assistant messages between tool_calls and tool_results, which MiniMax chat templates reject; FireConnect fails that model choice with an explanation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5b315f9ccf939448d2a0043b9db8cfab133ef4e5ce9557e3473415ab28ea9c5d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6df4c89f12a2819015ff4c8fc837acac5123920338a6f7f95f3311a6eace65d9","slc_83f987d57d07195ceddb149f05bacb1ef75cd16a1ad9a67c0d69a12f229cf5ff","slc_e0734d6b73656f739ce6ac6703fdf9c593a2bac8a30c6627185e3d27b5af8cbe"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"Claude Code subcommands include usage (interactive meter or --plain/--json snapshots), live (tmux split with a live usage meter), and demo (racing two models on a prompt).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5ff796ae2b21e3ed17ab0dfe6c404821903d201b3b301ea1a0a0e55053299ff6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1175fed2d5ef63351ea7e8e32725f7365b7f3662654b5df2e3727498856abb38","slc_cdbc75fadc8140127a3f2c80b25985da8a5859b0c49582c86b53c33f5d91be33","slc_ebf27ca1fd8b6a8bc5a3001c972654bedb885e5e5705dc86518d404bf2b769ea"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"Azure/Microsoft Foundry mode routes OpenCode, Codex, Pi, Cursor, and VS Code through an OpenAI-compatible Foundry endpoint using deployment names as model IDs; Claude Code is excluded because Foundry does not expose the Anthropic Messages API.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_667a582ca1410fc6655ba2867f62edb7530f5942d9cd2e5a673bd95663ddf27f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_43598d16686d0fc866afa92143bb485970b5bb880b721a3f8375777161d54cee","slc_4e48abc43e0e79ffdfb243484f877ba1d0321d0507f12c3d413d49aaa75b4c81"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"Rather than running a proxy, `on` rewrites each tool's own config, and `off` restores file-based harnesses byte-for-byte from a snapshot under ~/.fireconnect/ while removing only what FireConnect registered in IDEs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7fd2dbc90513889ad66bc4434fec5c18104dcf3fbb04a79fddbab7b2d16b79be","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_baaf30465c531c12f624f5ce80694f66bca6b84b733c6cd005f1d0937c98d678"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"Supported harnesses and config targets: Claude Code (settings.json), Codex (config.toml), OpenCode (opencode.json), Pi (three JSON files), Cursor (state.vscdb SQLite), VS Code Chat (chatLanguageModels.json + state.vscdb), DeepSeek Harness (settings.yaml + .credentials.yaml).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_91ca06e224f79165e53ab9e6dd4f8d961d12a2119fbcdd6d31cb0a321da78de3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1ac1e46dca0e5665f1623846a1cd5c7765ea60add0f1a79a29df0bd872e5a88e","slc_78535c7044f289da77bfeaeacbb7492838435815c599f0f607f7bc96e706849d","slc_8f951f844dd0df1071a5bef03aefdca1e3d79cee9308ff3ee383100d73ab7630","slc_aaadd3ee769bfeebfbed5fea62c384b21aeed6a9bc55b7602443b6fb2737fcde"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"Claude Code model mapping is configured via an interactive wizard (--interactive), per-slot flags (--model, --opus, --sonnet, --haiku, --fable, --subagent), or --non-interactive saved prefs for CI and scripts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c5b8a74b015fadefb3601c744a37cb67b55b44df81b0ee2fde1fe0d7c2e27f19","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_e60c9dd9d2e6d44f6d2a3d1df0389f1a3770c2a5bc0b80db5be0291dda44d06e","slc_e762b33958cb20c21b7bef8d35ddc3bef8edae6dbdc0116e9c1a299a3c616cda"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"Installation requires bash and Node.js 18+, clones the CLI to ~/.fireconnect/cli, and installs a launcher into ~/.local/bin; on Windows it must be run from Git Bash.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","created_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c848619cdc525f0429c873093694a68f279b55dc89d96e79c565b5aa3e9a3be7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"fw-ai/fireconnect@cc1d84179115 snapshot fd64e0c6a586cbaf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1331c87be6d32b81bb9c2101b7b3a2804358bd05a25d52b971097b76590660f2","slc_56633fae390167325cf959a7f16a79eda31b088e5b3c6fd843ad6f59d9f84447","slc_6a6d12b0bc583df95ce85a65fe8f1c32f4c3b4ac260c7a3b74b7b542c2107b52"],"source_ids":["src_0eb6285214eb5d67b6efdd702d2e0069"],"text":"The installed statusLine recomputes session cost from the transcript at Fireworks rates (Claude Code's own estimate uses Anthropic list prices), showing a bar sized by each model's share of spend plus per-model cost and cache-hit rate; NO_COLOR strips it to plain text.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:49Z","updated_by_operation":"op_6947128bf0334098a5b9c4cd8cd57af3"}
